Package: leios.theme.grub-theme
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: grub-common
Description: LeiOS GRUB2 gfxmenu theme
 This package provides the LeiOS theme for the GRUB2 boot menu.
 .
 It includes the theme description, background image, fonts, icons and
 selection artwork for GRUB's gfxmenu subsystem. On installation the
 theme is activated in /etc/default/grub and update-grub is run; on
 removal the theme line is removed and GRUB is updated again.
